<font class="print-normal">After much heart ache and deliberation a decision has been reached that is in the best interest of CH as a guild. We are merging with EOS.  At this time I would please request that each and every member of CH immediately apply for a boards account at <A href="http://www.exilesofthesun.com">http://www.exilesofthesun.com</A> and post your Toons, Toon levels, and Rank within our guild Heirarchy.  Additionally please find a member of the CH or EOS IC (we will become o­ne IC o­nce the merger is complete) and swear to EOS or at the very least bind to their tree. Harmony will be under construction soon as the new TRAINER CITY of our combined and powerful guild.  Though at this time, I do not require that each of you swear to EOS if you would rather keep your CH crest I do request it as it will make this transition much simpler and help to breed a sense of o­neness for our new combined family.Thank you for your votes. All of them were counted and as our diplomatic union has always done, the majority ruled.Your nominal leader,Llewin<br />
